\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Yes. 
\f1\b Saturday 8 August 2370
\f0\b0  is almost indecently good.\
It gives you two contradictory layers, which is much more useful than a date that merely screams \'93unlucky\'94.\
Superficially, it looks 
\f1\b spectacularly auspicious for an Elvis inauguration
\f0\b0 :\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Elvis was born on the 
\f1\b 8th
\f0\b0 .\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The inauguration is 
\f1\b 8/8
\f0\b0 .\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 It falls on a 
\f1\b Saturday
\f0\b0 , which Cheiro associates with Saturn and the number 8.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Cheiro says people of the 8 should favour the 8th, 17th and 26th, particularly when these fall on Saturday/Sunday/Monday. ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.deceptionary.com/ftp/Numerology-Cheiro.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 Deceptionary}})\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 So whoever schedules the inauguration can be absolutely delighted with themselves:\

\f1\b 8/8. Saturday. The King's number doubled.
\f0\b0 \
But using the same deliberately opportunistic full-date arithmetic we've been playing with:\

\f1\b 08/08/2370
\f0\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 8 + 8 + 2 + 3 + 7 = 28
\f0\fs24 \
And Cheiro says 
\f1\b 28 is specifically unfortunate for future events
\f0\b0 : great promise followed by loss, misplaced trust, opposition, and the possibility of having to begin again. ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.deceptionary.com/ftp/Numerology-Cheiro.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 Deceptionary}})\
That's excellent for an inauguration that precedes disaster.\
Even number 
\f1\b 8 itself
\f0\b0  has a dark underside in Cheiro. He associates it with 
\f1\b irrevocable Fate
\f0\b0 , and one face of it with \'93upheaval, revolution, anarchy\'94; he also says it is not generally fortunate from a worldly standpoint. ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.deceptionary.com/ftp/Numerology-Cheiro.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 Deceptionary}})\
So the date is beautifully double-faced:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 What the organisers see
\f0\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 8 August.\strokec2 \uc0\u8232 \strokec2 Saturday.\strokec2 \uc0\u8232 \strokec2 Elvis = 8.\strokec2 \uc0\u8232 \strokec2 Double Elvis.\strokec2 \uc0\u8232 \strokec2 Obviously ordained.\strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 What the numerologist notices afterwards
\f0\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 08/08/2370 = 
\f1\b 28
\f0\b0 .\strokec2 \uc0\u8232 \strokec2 Not fortunate for future events.\strokec2 \uc0\u8232 \strokec2 Loss through trust. Opposition. Everything gained potentially taken away.\strokec2 \uc0\u8232 \strokec2 Also: Fate, upheaval, revolution, anarchy.\strokec2 \
Given that the inauguration leads into the airborne-virus/Bent Street catastrophe, 
\f1\b Saturday 8 August 2370
\f0\b0  would be my choice.\
